          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP097 Calgary - Replacement [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I (figuratively) picked this one up while in the area. A nice, easy, uneventful find. TFTBC. &lt;/p&gt;

